{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_wildmn_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_wildmn_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "憧憬",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_wildmn_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "2a3742f2c099c382f53de1be0e64470fa44038012fb7aa4aba14640c10c735cc",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“艾沃娜，你的理想是什么呀？”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "听闻艾沃娜的回答，父母满意地笑了起来。来做客的叔叔高兴地摸了摸小艾沃娜的头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_kxstreet"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "名单上的感染者就差最后一个没联系了？这么快？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那当然，我的速度你还不知道？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "太好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有其他要联系的人吗？都包在我身上好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "让我看看......\n今天没有了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "联系上这位卡利什先生之后，你就可以放一下午的假啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放假？我不需要放假。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "艾沃娜，你应该好好休息一下了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（等等，那是......征战骑士？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "不远处的书报亭前站着一位征战骑士，看见他的艾沃娜自然而然地停下脚步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "书报亭老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这一款......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "征战骑士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不是......哪个......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "看着征战骑士似乎陷入了什么麻烦，艾沃娜并未多想，快步走上前去。\n她没能在停电那一夜目睹银枪天马进城的场景，但在那之后铺天盖地的新闻和照片，仍然让她心潮澎湃。\n对她而言，那无疑是一道划破卡西米尔霓虹色夜空的闪电。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "索娜，我有点事先挂了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "可你的假期——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道了，等联系上卡利什先生之后，我下午会好好休个假的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "回见！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（冷静，艾沃娜，冷静。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你好，需要什么帮助吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "征战骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "艾沃娜看见，征战骑士对着犹豫不决的东西，是两张彩票。\n征战骑士，彩票。\n这样的组合她永远都想不到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......艾沃娜·克鲁科夫斯卡，感染者竞技骑士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉打扰，如果没什么要紧事我先走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "征战骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请等一等，你知道这两种彩票——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我对这些不熟......再见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "征战骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_kxstreet"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么堂堂征战骑士会去买彩票？为什么会对这种乌烟瘴气的东西感兴趣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算了，不想了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他大概只是好奇，因为没见过，一定是这么回事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G10"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让我看看......卡利什先生的家是在这里没错......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡利什先生？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡利什",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......艾、艾沃娜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她要找的卡利什躺在自家门口，捂着腿上的伤口呻吟，血从他的指缝间涌出来。\n周围空无一人，没人敢上前来帮助这位受伤的感染者，原因显而易见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是无胄盟？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡利什",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（痛苦地点头）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们去哪儿了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡利什",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（指向巷子深处）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "该死！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "艾沃娜替卡利什紧急包扎了伤口，随即握紧了自己的骑枪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我去找他们算总账——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "话刚说出口，她突然想到，把一个刚刚受过袭击的感染者扔在这里，这样真的好吗？\n以前的野鬃骑士不考虑这些，她只想握紧骑枪冲锋，可现在不一样。她是红松骑士团的野鬃。\n但是，放任那些杀手溜走，会不会把自己和卡利什共同拖进危险——\n正在这时，她看到一个人正好从巷口经过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂——听得到吗？喂！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "征战骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "艾沃娜·克鲁......克鲁科夫斯卡小姐？你有什么事——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "征战骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这个人......是谁把他伤成这样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是无胄盟，我正要去给他们一个教训。这位卡利什先生拜托给你可以吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "征战骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没问题——等等，他和你一样是个感染者？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是又怎样——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "征战骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我得注意点，不能碰他的血，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "征战骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去吧，给那群阴沟里的虫子一个教训！卡利什就交给我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多谢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "麻烦你送卡利什先生去红松骑士团的安全屋，他认得路！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这张卡片上是红松骑士团的徽记，到了那里就把卡片给那里的人看，他们会知道出了什么事的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G10"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "站住！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你无路可逃了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......很能跑啊，小姑娘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们为什么要对卡利什下手？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "第一，我也不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "第二，我认出你来了，野鬃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你和我同事之前好像闹得挺大，不过那不是我的事，跟我无关。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你应该改改这个暴脾气，真的。我们又没要那家伙的命，你何苦来蹚浑水呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "少废话，看招！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我承认我打不过你，但你本来也不在我的目标名单上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都要走了，少给自己找点麻烦，不好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你知道我们要离开？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们可是公众人物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很久以前，我还押过你几次，结果赔得稀里哗啦——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我现在跟你算的是卡利什的账！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算是上面的命令，你们滥杀无辜的时候，扣扳机的手指就不会抖吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我手指抖了，我好怕啊，小姐，所以能留我一命吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不要你的命，我要你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "给卡利什——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "道歉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，那我也无话可说了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只能说，能遇到焰尾那一群人，你真的很幸运，小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是和她们一起出来，你或许还能捡回一条命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "无胄盟成员的力道稍减。\n艾沃娜在无数次搏杀中磨练出来的直觉告诉她——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放冷箭的家伙？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "躲在哪里？看我揪你出来——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "隐藏的无胄盟成员箭箭指向艾沃娜的要害，艾沃娜只能不断地闪避。\n然后，她看到，刚刚被她逼到墙角的人也掏出了弓，瞄准了她的眼睛——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "征战骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "躲在阴影里的虫豸，滚出来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "征战骑士......先生？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "征战骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们保卫卡西米尔，不是为了给你们提供腐败的温床！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "征战骑士？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "征战骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "艾沃娜，小心他们偷袭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "征战骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "注意四周的动静，我们赶紧离开这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_kxstreet"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "嗯！征战骑士先生把卡利什先生送来了，罗德岛的医生也在，不用担心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "你最近也累坏了，好好享受这个下午吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请问我该怎么称呼你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "征战骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你可以叫我马索夫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "马索夫先生，真的，太谢谢你了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马索夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没必要这么客气，我也只是休假时碰巧路过，就搭把手罢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马索夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁会喜欢无胄盟这种脏东西呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，说得好！没人喜欢无胄盟这种脏东西！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说起来，正好我今天下午也休假，我们找个地方喝一杯怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马索夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喝一杯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊！我请客！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马索夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，这......好、好啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走，喝酒去，喝酒去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_sportsbar"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奇怪，酒吧难道不是越热闹越好吗？你怎么拉着我进了这么家没什么人的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马索夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这......我喜欢清静一点的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过这家的酒也不错。干杯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马索夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "干杯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马索夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这酒确实不错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "马索夫老兄，你们征战骑士进入大骑士领那一晚，我因为和无胄盟打架，没在现场看到你们的身影。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是那之后的新闻报道，我一期不落地看了！真是太酷了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马索夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大骑士领就需要你们这样的人，把那些两面三刀的家伙脸上的面具扔到地上，再狠狠踩上两脚！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你知道商业联合会那些人把我们感染者骑士看成什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马索夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看成什么？难道不就是感染了矿石病的竞技骑士吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，竞技骑士对他们来说是提线木偶，而我们感染者骑士连木偶都算不上，完全就是一块破抹布！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "每次骑士竞技出了什么乱子，他们永远都能找到一个完全无关的感染者骑士，把责任一股脑推给他！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等到他们想吹嘘自己对感染者不错，我们就又被推到台前，当成“优待”的证明展览给其他人......一想到这些，我肺都要气炸了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马索夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们怎么能这样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就说刚才那些无胄盟吧。自从我们红松骑士团有了一些名声，他们就没少找上门来，就因为我们不愿意被商业联合会当成破抹布！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "停电那晚，我差点被他们杀了，我的同伴也因为他们遭遇了生命危险！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马索夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也听说过不少无胄盟的传闻，但他们敢在大骑士领这么肆无忌惮，我今天也是头一次见......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就因为我们要帮助感染者，和他们对着干，他们早就想把我们除掉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我们才不可能放弃。只要我还有一口气，就不可能坐视大骑士领把感染者嚼碎吞掉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马索夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......也没这么严重吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马索夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "无胄盟和商业联合会确实可恨，但你说整个大骑士领的话，至少卡西米尔的中枢还是愿意保护感染者的吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马索夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要不然，他们也不会同意设立感染者骑士这种制度了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你这么说，好像也......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，先不聊这个了，喝酒喝酒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马索夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老板，再来一杯威士忌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒吧老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要加冰？还是苏打水？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马索夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "纯饮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒吧老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒吧老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "给，你的威士忌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马索夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马索夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好酒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那......给我也来一杯一样的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒吧老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要加什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "纯饮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒吧老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小姑娘，这东西纯饮劲很大的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没关系。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒吧老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好嘞......稍等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_sportsbar"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳、咳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好酒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "马索夫老兄，说起来，我刚刚在街上见到你的时候，你好像在看彩票？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马索夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "听我一句，那东西就是个无底洞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "索娜跟我说过，彩票都是设计好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "容易中奖的都只能中些小钱，号称有大奖的几乎没人能中！还有那些押骑士竞技胜负的，几乎全都有人在背后操纵——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉汉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "胡......胡说八道！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉汉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我表哥，上个月买、买了彩票，中了一大笔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可这些都是少数。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉汉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......也经常押骑士竞技的胜负，我也、也没少赢钱！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是索娜说过，彩票的发行商早都算好了，你们赢到手里的钱是不可能比花出去买彩票的钱多的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉汉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "胡扯，完全是胡扯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉汉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我表哥本来病得很重了，他是靠那笔奖金才活下来的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那也只是特殊情况——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉汉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么特殊情况，我看你是找揍！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉汉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对了，你刚才说过吧，自己是感染者？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那又怎样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉汉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感染者就该、就该扔到大骑士领外面去，省得污染街道......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你再说一遍试试？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉汉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么，感染者还敢来撒野——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "艾沃娜一把抓起了醉汉的领子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你再说一遍？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉汉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉汉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，得意什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉汉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在的骑士真是越来越差劲了，先是同意感染者当竞技骑士，现在连征战骑士也和感染者混在——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一直坐着的马索夫腾地站了起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马索夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先生，你得为自己对征战骑士的污蔑负责。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉汉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉汉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“先生，你得为自己对征战骑士的污蔑负责”——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这句话太帅了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "马索夫老兄，对付这种败兴的家伙，还是你有经验啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马索夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这种人不识好歹，等他酒醒就知道怕了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过就算被那家伙搅了一通我也得说，彩票这东西最好别碰。那就是商业联合会搞出来敛财的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马索夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感谢你的劝告，我不会再想着买什么彩票了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马索夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但彩票也不全是坏东西吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你说说，彩票好在哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马索夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "像那种可悲的家伙，至少能在里面得到一点点希望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......你说的有点......深奥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马索夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没什么，没什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就因为彩票之类的东西，自从我成为感染者骑士之后，总是有人想让我打假赛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马索夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "压力肯定很大吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "确实不小，但我从来就没听过他们的，啊哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赢就是赢，输就是输，我可不愿意为了区区几个钱就放弃胜利的荣耀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马索夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说得好。为了胜利的荣耀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为了胜利的荣耀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马索夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对了，艾沃娜，你姓什么来着？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马索夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我隐约有点印象，似乎有其他队伍里的骑士和你的姓氏差不多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "克鲁科夫斯卡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我家里确实有征战——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马索夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，接个电话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "马索夫，不是说了在梅什科工业大楼下面集合吗，你跑哪去了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马索夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我处理点事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么事情？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马索夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别支支吾吾了，我们都看见了，你进了一家酒吧，身边还有一个人，看起来像个竞技骑士！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看不出来，你小子也学坏了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马索夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪有的事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马索夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我现在就去找你们——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈哈，不用劳动你，我们已经在酒馆门外啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的同伴？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马索夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "马索夫有些僵硬地站起来，朝门外走去。\n逆着阳光，艾沃娜看见，那里站着三个征战骑士，正等着马索夫出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "征战骑士A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "马索夫，你小子能耐不小啊。为了骗口酒喝，你都和竞技骑士混到一起了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马索夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么骗酒喝，你们就喜欢瞎说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "征战骑士B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快出来吧，这种下等人扎堆的地方你也真进得去。那个竞技骑士的酒没让你喝坏肚子就不错了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "征战骑士B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还是说，你看上人家了，打算和她......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马索夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "胡说！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "征战骑士C",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "得了，你们少打趣他两句吧。他肯定也是迫不得已，这才跟这种顶着骑士头衔的渣滓混在一起的。你说呢，马索夫？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "马索夫窘迫地转头和艾沃娜对视了一眼。\n艾沃娜尚且震惊于那几名征战骑士的言论，无暇回应马索夫求助的眼神。\n马索夫于是回过头去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马索夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "少——少——少开这种没轻没重的玩笑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "征战骑士A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，马索夫来劲了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马索夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁认识这家伙啊，我是被她强拉来喝酒的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马索夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一个崇拜征战骑士的小姑娘罢了，连正经骑士的边都摸不到，谁和她混在一起了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马索夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要不是你们仨出来得晚，谁愿意在这种破地方喝酒啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "征战骑士B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瞎说，我刚才还看见你和她有说有笑呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马索夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就和她逗逗闷子。竞技骑士不就是用来给人解闷的家伙吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "征战骑士C",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了好了，出来再说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "马索夫，你？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "征战骑士A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦哟，这是什么？小卡片？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "征战骑士A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，没想到你这个看起来最老实的家伙还有这一手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "征战骑士A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "该不会这就是你们两个的秘密联络方式吧，放在火上一烤就能有字的那种？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马索夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "胡扯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "艾沃娜看见，马索夫把印着红松骑士团标志的卡片扔在地上，狠狠踏了上去，甚至还踩了好几脚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马索夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "跟你们说过了，就是逗逗闷子，你们还不信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马索夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这种竞技骑士，还是个感染者，我看上她？要不是她死缠烂打，我才不会来这种鬼地方！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "征战骑士A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗬，居然还是个感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "征战骑士B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啧啧啧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马索夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走，我们喝好酒去！这家店的酒难喝死了，没有哪个体面人受得了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "征战骑士们闹哄哄地走远了。\n艾沃娜在原地怔了一会儿。她此刻唯一能做的是把地上的卡片捡起来。\n卡片上，灰色的鞋印重重叠叠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这就是......征战骑士？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "艾沃娜回想着这位征战骑士从头到尾的表现。\n到底哪一面才是真正的马索夫？\n他愿意为了感染者的安危挺身而出，愿意和只有一面之缘的感染者竞技骑士一同喝酒。\n他把象征红松骑士团的卡片踩在脚下，他撒谎说自己死缠烂打，他说竞技骑士就是用来给人解闷的家伙。\n他......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒吧老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "给，小姑娘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......牧草伏特加？超大杯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我没点这种酒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒吧老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是我这儿最好的酒，送你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒吧老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刚才那家伙的事，你别往心里去。骑士老爷嘛，都是这样的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "骑士......老爷？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒吧老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要不然呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒吧老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看你这样子......算啦，你们这顿酒我请了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒吧老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你刚刚不是还帮我赶走了一个耍酒疯的吗？就当是报酬了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒吧老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "敞开喝吧，这间酒吧不就是为了你我这样的人开起来的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒吧老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗬，一口气喝光了一整杯酒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这么好的酒，不一口喝光怎么行！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天下午可是我难得的假期！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然不知道该怎么度过，但我可不能把假期给浪费了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_snowconutryinside"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "艾沃娜？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说好了下午放假的，你怎么这么早就回来了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（含混的嘟囔声）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，原来是喝多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和那位征战骑士先生一起喝的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（点头）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，那你睡吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇，这么快就睡着了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "艾沃娜酒量一直不错的，只有心情不好的时候才容易醉。这次醉得这么厉害，难道是闹了什么不愉快？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咿——呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "艾沃娜，怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "正......正......正义骑士号！集合！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "正义骑士号",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘀嘀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（原来是梦话啊......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......前几天......想把你，漆成，纯银的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "正义骑士号",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然后改名叫、叫、叫，银枪、天马、正义、征战——骑士号！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "正义骑士号",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘀嘀嘀？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我改主意了！你以后就......还是叫、正义骑士号、好了！漆也不用、不用刷了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "正义骑士号",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘀......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "解散！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "正义骑士号",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘀嘀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一张小小的卡片从艾沃娜口袋里掉了出来，上面是红松骑士团的标志，还有一串鞋印。\n进来给艾沃娜盖毛毯的索娜没有遗漏这张卡片。\n看着卡片上重叠的陌生鞋印，再联系上刚刚的梦话，她大概能想象出艾沃娜为何会醉成这个样子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "理想？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）艾沃娜？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要成为光荣的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好酒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "艾沃娜翻了个身，不再讲梦话，呼呼大睡起来。\n索娜叹了口气，收起脏污的卡片，把一张干净的卡片塞回艾沃娜的口袋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
